  "exactReuse": "Proposed file starts with every original baseline byte. Only additional exported closure; existing currentScope, recipe resolver, setup executor, inventory/hydration unchanged.",
  "joins": [
    "Resolve recipe once through existing fixed510 manifest/asset validator; returned spec is cloned and deeply frozen.",
    "At each assertion require exact top-level binding keys and recipe keys/hash, exactly510 ordered candidates/hash, and plan kind/schema/recipe/manifest/definitions/instance/selfhash.",
    "Scope result is derived from frozen spec and actual currentScope reads, not caller binding values after asynchronous work.",
    "Existing currentScope verifies current tenant namespace/slug, active synthetic Pat/Priya memberships and roles/Clerk bindings, canonical client scope and native approval authorization.",
    "The two native functions are captured and bound before awaited recipe resolution; method replacement after construction cannot replace ports.",
    "All scope reads and authorization calls receive exactly the supplied transaction. Closure opens no transaction or DB connection, performs no mutations, and returns only frozen tenant/user/client IDs."
  ],
